stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Acquired: item added / scan / manual entry

    Acquired --> InStock: quantity > threshold
    Acquired --> LowStock: quantity <= threshold and > 0
    Acquired --> OutOfStock: quantity = 0

    InStock --> LowStock: quantity updated / threshold reached
    LowStock --> InStock: restock above threshold
    LowStock --> OutOfStock: quantity reduced to 0
    InStock --> OutOfStock: quantity reduced to 0
    OutOfStock --> InStock: replenished / grocery run finalized

    InStock --> NearExpiry: scheduled sweep enters near-expiry window
    LowStock --> NearExpiry: scheduled sweep enters near-expiry window
    NearExpiry --> Expired: expiration date reached
    NearExpiry --> InStock: expiration date extended / corrected
    Expired --> InStock: expiration date corrected and item still usable

    InStock --> Lent: item lent [conceptual]
    Lent --> InStock: item returned [conceptual]
    Lent --> Lost: item marked lost [conceptual]
    InStock --> Lost: item marked lost [conceptual]
    LowStock --> Lost: item marked lost [conceptual]

    Expired --> Discarded: user marks discarded / thrown away
    Discarded --> Archived: preserve historical record
    OutOfStock --> Archived: user archives inactive item record
    Expired --> Archived: user archives expired item record
    Lost --> Archived: user archives lost item record [conceptual]

    Archived --> [*]: hidden from active inventory views